      "tag_prose": "saharan_trade_control"
    },
    {
      "tag": "religious_legitimacy",
      "layer": "ideology_religion",
      "description": "Marinid sultans built madrasas at Fez, Salé, and Meknes, positioning themselves as champions of Sunni Maliki scholarship and attracting scholars from across the Islamic world including Ibn Khaldun",
      "sources": [
        {
